    <string name="privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="everything_stays_device_notification_content">Notification content is rendered straight into the overlay and never stored, logged or uploaded. Nothing leaves the phone unless you switch on lyrics or weather, which send only the song’s details or your area rounded to about 10 km — and the update check, which sends nothing at all.</string>
